#. module: ai_translation_consensus
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:ai_translation_consensus.view_ai_translation_wizard_form
msgid ""
"<b>Approve</b> (menu Proposals): each proposal shows the candidates, who wrote\n"
"                            them, the scores and the reviewers' remarks. Apply the proposal, pick another\n"
"                            candidate, type your own wording, or reject it."
msgstr ""

#. module: ai_translation_consensus
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:ai_translation_consensus.view_ai_translation_wizard_form
msgid ""
"<b>Process</b>: on the rule press <i>Process one batch</i> (repeat until done) or\n"
"                            switch on the scheduled action for unattended runs. This is when providers are\n"
"                            called and costs arise."
msgstr ""

#. module: ai_translation_consensus
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:ai_translation_consensus.view_ai_translation_wizard_form
msgid ""
"<b>Providers</b> (menu Providers): switch on the services you want. Free ones\n"
"                            need no key; for the others enter your key, press <i>Test connection</i> and\n"
"                            activate. Two or more providers give a real cross-check."
msgstr ""

#. module: ai_translation_consensus
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:ai_translation_consensus.view_ai_translation_wizard_form
msgid ""
"<b>Rule</b> (this wizard creates it): which records and fields, which languages,\n"
"                            which providers, and which hints (tone, subject area, names that stay as they are)."
msgstr ""

#. module: ai_translation_consensus
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:ai_translation_consensus.view_ai_translation_wizard_form
msgid ""
"<b>Search</b>: the rule lists the texts that still need work as proposals. Nothing\n"
"                            is sent to a provider yet, so this is free."
msgstr ""

#. module: ai_translation_consensus
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:ai_translation_consensus.view_ai_translation_wizard_form
msgid ""
"<b>Source language</b> is the language slot in Odoo that holds the original text. If the\n"
"                        text in that slot is really written in another language (for example German kept in\n"
"                        the English slot), enter the real one under <i>Text is really written in</i>.\n"
"                        <b>Only missing</b> skips what is already translated."
msgstr ""

#. module: ai_translation_consensus
#: model_terms:ir.actions.act_window,help:ai_translation_consensus.action_ai_translation_unit
msgid ""
"A proposal is one text block with the wordings the providers wrote for it, their\n"
"                scores and remarks. They appear when a rule has searched for texts and the batch\n"
"                was processed. Create a rule with <i>Start here</i>, or open a rule and press\n"
"                <i>Scan now</i> and <i>Process one batch</i>. Then apply, change or reject each\n"
"                proposal here."
msgstr ""

#. module: ai_translation_consensus
#: model_terms:ir.actions.act_window,help:ai_translation_consensus.action_ai_translation_watch
msgid ""
"A rule says which records and fields are translated or proofread, in which languages,\n"
"                by which providers. The easiest way to create one is <i>Start here</i> in the menu,\n"
"                which explains each step. Rules do nothing on their own until you press\n"
"                <i>Scan now</i> / <i>Process one batch</i> or switch on the scheduled action."
msgstr ""

